  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IQ-TF EMERG. BAGHDAD WATER SUPPLY</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The principal objective of the project is to assist in restoring basic water supply and sanitation services for the capital city of Baghdad through (a) the reconstruction and rehabilitation of existing priority networks and treatment facilities and (b) providing capacity building support through training and technical assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
